  <item>
    <title>20.亚撒西是非常珍贵的品质！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a53364a1e32575f5eb510c2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a53364a1e32575f5eb510c2</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 12 Jul 2026 06:40:23 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 本人crush取向之一：温柔</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="140">02:20</a>《鬼灭之刃》是一部非常温暖、温柔的番剧</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="661">11:01</a> 炼狱杏寿郎-“老去或是死亡，都是人类这种短暂生物的美德。正因为会老、会死，才令人觉得可爱、尊贵。”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1088">18:08</a> 炭治郎-对鬼的临终怜悯</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1787">29:47</a> 弥豆子-真正能称之为人性的是，那种超越利害计算的东西，比如英雄主义、利他主义，为了他人或某种信念而牺牲自己的冲动。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2054">34:14</a> 温柔地肯定一下！</span></p><p></p><p></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65392b2417f714197f8dc18b/lpLyNcPlI-ITmS3q4XjnNHEXEVsT.m4a" length="36089816" type="audio/mp4"/>
