  <item>
    <title>S2.E04 事已至此，先睡觉</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68d7e2f4b4befcf7303019c9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68d7e2f4b4befcf7303019c9</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 27 Sep 2025 13:21:32 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>1. <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="81">01:21</a> 就医风云</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="91">01:31</a> 牙齿历险记——以为牙齿很健康，原来是没看牙医...</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="694">11:34</a> 皮质醇大爆炸——只来的及说一句：医生，我...不想吃药...</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="935">15:35</a> 堂堂不知名大皮炎暴风袭来——已和解，持续被监督...</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1226">20:26</a> 没逃过的右膝劫难——死人才没积液！滑膜皱壁又是什么？！</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1553">25:53</a> 高潮的神来一崴——你可体验过夏日高温水泥地的温暖与剧痛？...</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>2. <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1916">31:56</a> 增肌也可以放心地歇！（仅从普通人以健康为目的开始健身的角度出发</span></p><span></span><p><span>3. <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2075">34:35</a> 睡大觉真是“人生筵席上主要的滋补品”</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2325">38:45</a> 睡眠如何提高我们的记忆力？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2563">42:43</a> 熟能加上睡眠才能生巧！</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2738">45:38</a> 早上不如多睡会...</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2890">48:10</a> 睡眠比我们想象得更聪明，竟然可以有选择性地筛选记忆。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3341">55:41</a> 午夜梦回对创造力的滋养</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3583">59:43</a> 有时候熬夜熬high了，其实是大脑失控了，不是真high了呀！</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4160">69:20</a> 以为嘴馋了，其实是没睡够</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4632">77:12</a> 熬夜熬穿了，为什么会又困又精神？</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>4. <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4750">79:10</a> 自我push和自我接纳的界限到底在哪里?</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4795">79:55</a> 我现在觉得自己最天才的地方是在所有方面都很平庸。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5245">87:25</a> 最近时常感觉生活才刚刚向我展露出了可怕的冰山一角。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5517">91:57</a> 事缓则圆，最慢的就是最快的。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>5. <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5539">92:19</a> 停止责怪自己是一切美好的开始</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5574">92:54</a> 好了，不要再责怪自己了。</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65392b2417f714197f8dc18b/lv5EnpcosMwiV3G8JQZ6ycDLGimG.m4a" length="141003835" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:35:12</itunes:duration>
