  <item>
    <title>S1.E11 你今天和食物相处得好吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/679738fad74435e4a308aebc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">679738fad74435e4a308aebc</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 01 Feb 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>Shownotes</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>这一期分享如何与食物建立合作关系，以及如何为自己定制营养全面的饮食。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Timeline</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 这期节目的创作契机——和猫打架，将腰扭伤</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="214">03:34</a> 我为何不认同节食</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="477">07:57</a> 了解大脑如何处理饥饿感与进食</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="779">12:59</a> 如何与食物建立合作关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="967">16:07</a>从细胞层面观察我们为何会生病</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1239">20:39</a>为何要全面饮食</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1397">23:17</a> 食物种类多不等于营养全面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1675">27:55</a> 地中海饮食的亮点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1992">33:12</a> 解读《中国居民膳食指南》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2409">40:09</a> 牛奶是一种近乎完美的食物</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2821">47:01</a>：喝粥其实并不养胃</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2933">48:53</a> 油不怕多，只怕比例不当</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3044">50:44</a> 挑蔬菜时可以看颜色和部位</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3280">54:40</a> 水果可以充当一部分正餐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3480">58:00</a> 我最近的饮食改变</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>BGM：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Brunch for two——Tokyo Music Walker</span></p><span></span><p><span>Dandelion——Next Route</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Reference</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《你是你吃出来的》——夏萌</span></p><span></span><p><span>《减肥不是挨饿，而是与食物合作》——伊芙琳·特里弗雷</span></p>]]></description>
